CPEPrefix: unknown

Description:
Mozilla's fork of Google ANGLE, repackaged as a Rust crate.

Local Modifications:
Updated with tools/import.py mozangle (history replayed linearly); how far behind it is: `bun testing/acceptance.ts track`.
The crates (1) live in third_party/mozangle/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by tools/flatten.py
(path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate). Lockfiles of the upstream are not kept.
Patches: none. Integration fixes: yes, in tools/fixups.sh.
Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/mozangle/ unchanged.

Crates:
  mozangle 0.7.1 third_party/mozangle/mozangle
